(7569784, 1215224, 67258, '<td valign="top">Ha! Clever. Still life with pairs/pears - totally random, and all the better for it.Trying to work out if the bark has any significance other than its aesthetic appeal.  Possibly a tiny bit more contrast may give the photo a little more ''pop'', and it would be interesting to see it in mono - might play to the different textures.</td>', 'Ha! Clever. Still life with pairs/pears - totally random, and all the better for it.Trying to work out if the bark has any significance other than its aesthetic appeal.  Possibly a tiny bit more contrast may give the photo a little more ''pop'', and it would be interesting to see it in mono - might play to the different textures.', '2018-06-01 07:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7569785, 1215140, 67258, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea, good composition and the bright colour palette works really well for the image.  There does seem to be some processing artefacting going on around the girls arm, which once spotted is quite distracting.</td>', 'Excellent idea, good composition and the bright colour palette works really well for the image.  There does seem to be some processing artefacting going on around the girls arm, which once spotted is quite distracting.', '2018-06-01 07:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7569786, 1215195, 67258, '<td valign="top">Good idea, pleasingly composed.  Personally, I would have preferred it if the music sheet wasn''t in a plastic sleeve.</td>', 'Good idea, pleasingly composed.  Personally, I would have preferred it if the music sheet wasn''t in a plastic sleeve.', '2018-06-01 07:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7569788, 1215207, 67258, '<td valign="top">Good idea, well photographed, well composed, and well titled.</td>', 'Good idea, well photographed, well composed, and well titled.', '2018-06-01 07:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7569789, 1215109, 67258, '<td valign="top">Ha, a well thought out entry.  I have no idea how you did the Fore image in standard editing, but it is hilarious.</td>', 'Ha, a well thought out entry.  I have no idea how you did the Fore image in standard editing, but it is hilarious.', '2018-06-01 07:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
