(7569792, 1215151, 67258, '<td valign="top">In British English pronounciation these wouldn''t be classed as homophones, but perhaps with other accents they are.  A thought provoking pair of photographs which take some effort on the part of the viewer to decode (a good thing).</td>', 'In British English pronounciation these wouldn''t be classed as homophones, but perhaps with other accents they are.  A thought provoking pair of photographs which take some effort on the part of the viewer to decode (a good thing).', '2018-06-01 07:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
