(7569813, 1215111, 67258, '<td valign="top">A pleasing pair - I like the limited colour palette, and the old chopping board adds just the right amount of interest without becoming dominant.  My only slight disagreement with your composition is in the way the board leans to the right as it recedes - for some reason it slightly bothers me.</td>', 'A pleasing pair - I like the limited colour palette, and the old chopping board adds just the right amount of interest without becoming dominant.  My only slight disagreement with your composition is in the way the board leans to the right as it recedes - for some reason it slightly bothers me.', '2018-06-01 09:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
