(7570312, 1215189, 67258, '<td valign="top"><strike></strike>A pleasing diptych.  I like the ''modern'' feel to the image, and the cleanness of it.  You have handled the transition from the table top to the background well.  The only thing I am not so keen on is your handling of the border, in particular where the two photos meet.</td>', 'A pleasing diptych.  I like the ''modern'' feel to the image, and the cleanness of it.  You have handled the transition from the table top to the background well.  The only thing I am not so keen on is your handling of the border, in particular where the two photos meet.', '2018-06-05 11:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
